<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-019" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-019-jin043-shantao" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-019-jin043-shantao">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-019-jin043-shantao:wife" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">山妻<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-019-jin043-shantao:wife:m0002" ref="1ix_v4q_f6b">韓氏</persName>，覺公與二人異於常交，問公。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-019-jin043-shantao:wangyin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-019-jin043-shantao:wangyin:m0000" ref="1ix_v4q_f6b">韓氏</persName>有才識，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-019-jin043-shantao:wangyin:m0006" ref="96a_987_925">濤</persName>未仕時，戲之曰：『忍寒，我當作三公，不知卿堪為夫人不耳？』</p>
</text>
